# The web image only needs the two payload trees. Everything else (node_modules,
# dist, android build outputs, Dev-Docs, the MCP server) stays out of the context.
*
!android
!android/app
!android/app/src
!android/app/src/main
!android/app/src/main/assets
!android/app/src/main/assets/public
!public
!public/voice
!public/voice/guides
